@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam ParticipantPadding 16
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 38
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Developer" as Dev
participant "Trace UI" as UI
participant "Commit\nController" as Controller
participant "LLM Service\n(LLM module)" as LlmService
participant "Prompt\nBuilder" as PromptService
participant "Guidance\nService" as GuidanceService
participant "Azure DevOps" as ADO
participant "Gemini\nAPI" as Gemini

Dev -> UI: Request commit review
UI -> Controller: GET /commits/hf/review?project&repositoryName&commitId

Controller -> LlmService: reviewCommit(project, repositoryName, commitId)
LlmService -> ADO: Resolve repository and commit metadata
ADO --> LlmService: Repository references

LlmService -> PromptService: buildCommitReviewPrompt(...)
PromptService -> ADO: getCommit + getChanges + relevant file snapshots
ADO --> PromptService: Commit data + code snapshots
PromptService -> GuidanceService: buildReviewerGuidance(changedPaths)
GuidanceService --> PromptService: Matching instructions and skills
PromptService --> LlmService: Final review prompt

LlmService -> Gemini: generateContent(prompt)
Gemini --> LlmService: Review result
LlmService --> Controller: Review text
Controller --> UI: CommitReviewResponseDto
UI --> Dev: Render LLM review findings
@enduml
